  "topic": "What is Multi Agent framework",
  "description": "What is Multi Agent framework",
  "script": "Did you know AIs are now teaming up to solve problems like a squad? You're seeing a new AI era emerge now. One AI can't handle every complex task. Multi-agent frameworks let AIs collaborate. Single AI limits are becoming very clear. You're needing more than one smart bot now. Complex challenges need specialized teamwork. Multi-agent systems offer a better solution. Most people imagine one super-smart AI. But here's a huge surprise for you. Collaborative AI systems achieve shocking results. They solve problems five times faster, truly. Or they boast 70% higher accuracy. Imagine a highly skilled orchestra playing. Each AI musician plays its specific part. They perform in perfect, beautiful synchronicity. Together, they create a symphony of solutions. AIs now form sophisticated, problem-solving teams. You're seeing technology evolve dramatically now. They'll unlock previously impossible challenges. What future will these systems create next?",
